SUMMARY:AI Series: AI for Finance and Budget Optimization
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T103000
UID:9170e21f09c7feccbd57324fb3d7a765@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Financial clarity is essential for sustainable growth. This se
 ssion explores how AI tools can support smarter budgeting\, forecasting\, 
 and financial decision-making- without replacing professional oversight. P
 articipants will learn how AI can help predict cash flow\, analyze pricing
  strategies\, and categorize expenses to uncover trends and opportunities.
  The focus is on using data to improve visibility\, plan ahead\, and make 
 more informed financial choices. You'll leran how to: Use AI to support ca
 sh flow forecasting Analyze pricing and expenses more effectively Improve 
 budget planning and financial insight
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-a
 i-for-finance-and-budget-optimization
