 sinesses looking to better understand how AI can support their operations.
  Participants are encouraged to bring real questions\, challenges\, or ide
 as to the session. Together\, we'll explore how AI might help address spec
 ific issues- or whether existing tools and solutions are already available
 . The focus is on pratical problem-solving\, shared learning\, and real-wo
 rld application. What to expect: Open Q&A and group discussion Exploration
  of AI solutions for real business challenges Guidance on next steps and a
 vailable tools
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-o
 pen-forum
